{"slug":"Depth-Spelunking-or-Auto-Farm-227150","_id":"6a9f24b61166dc9d00e4b51b","title":"Auto Farm","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78b73","gameId":8253643436,"name":"Depth Spelunking","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8253643436},"features":"⚠️ Warning Do not use this in Daily Mode or Modifiers Mode because they track your game completion time.\n\nAimia — Depth Spelunking\nAn auto-farm hub for Depth Spelunking. Run it, enter your key, turn on Auto Run, and it handles the rest.\n\n[Function]\nAuto Run — clears tasks, returns to the elevator, and descends to your set floor on its own\nSpeed Mode — Default / Master (Master is ~3.5× faster; if the server can't keep up it drops back to Default automatically)\nExit Floor — pick the floor to leave on\nTask Camera — point the camera at each task (toggle on/off)\n\n[How to use]\nRun the script → enter your key → open the Auto Task tab and hit Auto Run → set your exit floor under Run Control → Exit Floor. Done — no need to press E yourself.\n\n[Update]\n• Supports every task type, hooked automatically — no re-running between floors\n• Added Speed Mode (Master fast mode)\n• Choose to clear only what's required, or every task on the floor\n• Set your own exit floor\n\n[Fixed]\n• Your character no longer disappears while doing a task\n\n[Notes]\n• With no run active, Auto Run stays idle and does nothing\n• Keys last about 12 hours — renew through the key window when it expires\n\nNew features coming soon\nhttps://discord.gg/YdJEQnVyBp","tags":["Depth Spelunking","Depth Spelunking Auto Farm","Depth Spelunking Auto Task","Depth Spelunking Auto","Auto farm"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AimikaNarak/database/refs/heads/main/DepthSpelunkingAutoFarm.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a7dd82114cb76355a11560a","username":"AimikaExcusia","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":